What are Robot Wiring Harnesses and Cables?
Robot Wiring Harness and Cables are structured assemblies of electrical cables, connectors, and protective sheathing designed to transmit power, signals, and data within robotic systems. They ensure organized, reliable, and efficient electrical connectivity in industrial robots, autonomous machines, and robotic arms while minimizing interference and mechanical stress.
These components serve as the nervous system of robots, enabling precise movements and coordinated operation of complex electromechanical systems across automotive assembly lines, surgical robots, logistics automation, and more.
